> Using Section7703 as S7703
> Using Section152 as S152
> Using Section68 as S68
> Using Section151 as Src

Generated by `cutecat_scripts/generate_dataset.py`; edits are
overwritten. Each scope below adds no rule: it declares one input
per parameter of a top-level function of the port and returns what
that function returns. CUTECat explores one entry point per run,
and a top-level function is not one until something names it.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope FnSameExemption:
  input a content Src.Exemption
  input b content Src.Exemption
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnDedup:
  input xs content list of Src.Exemption
  output result content list of Src.Exemption

declaration scope FnInjectedExemptions:
  input injections content list of W.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  input person_pos content integer
  input amount_pos content integer
  output result content list of Src.Exemption

declaration scope FnSuspendedYear:
  input y content integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnCeilOf:
  input x content decimal
  output result content decimal

```

```catala
scope FnSameExemption:
  definition result equals Src.same_exemption of a, b

scope FnDedup:
  definition result equals Src.dedup of xs

scope FnInjectedExemptions:
  definition result equals Src.injected_exemptions of injections, pred, pattern, person_pos, amount_pos

scope FnSuspendedYear:
  definition result equals Src.suspended_year of y

scope FnCeilOf:
  definition result equals Src.ceil_of of x

```
